                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans shut down the government instead of working to lower health care costs. Service members and federal workers in Michigan and across the country aren't getting paid.\u00a0\n\nNo member of Congress should get a paycheck while this continues - and that's why I'm refusing mine.\n\nAnd I won\u2019t stop doing what I\u2019ve always done: fighting to lower costs, protecting health care, and delivering for Michigan families who deserve better.",
