                "text": "Let\u2019s be clear: high health care costs are wrong. Kicking people off their health care is wrong. And that\u2019s exactly what we\u2019re facing right now.\n\nMichiganders are speaking out, and I hear them loud and clear. I'm fighting every day to protect health care and lower costs. https://t.co/b8MbNBwx9P",
