                "quoted_status_profile_username": "washingtonpost",
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Michiganders are telling me every day that they\u2019re being stretched thin\u2014higher prices, rising health care costs, and now missed paychecks because of Trump\u2019s shutdown. And somehow Trump\u2019s priority is a multimillion-dollar renovation of the East Wing?\n\nIt\u2019s outrageous. Michiganders deserve better. I\u2019ll keep pushing for a real deal that puts Michiganders first.",
